    description: "The exclude_tests filter in rslice prod mode only checks file paths (tests?/, spec/), not Rust #[test] attributes. Inline test functions in src/ modules pass through unexcluded. The annotation data IS present in node.meta.annotations — it just needs to be consulted. Affects 7+ repos: rodio, scap, mermaid-rs-renderer, codex-acp, candle, imara-diff, client-sdk-js."  # 6e1b
